       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. OVDKY8.
      * RE-KYC DOCUMENT ACCEPTANCE
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY OVDTB8.
       01  WS-REKYC-RESULT           PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-PROOF-CODE
           IF OFFICIAL-PROOF8
              MOVE 'VERIFIED' TO WS-REKYC-RESULT
           ELSE
              MOVE 'REJECTED' TO WS-REKYC-RESULT
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'REKYC: ' WS-REKYC-RESULT
           STOP RUN.
